    "\n",
    "## Invertibility\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{style=\"font-size: .8em\"}\n",
    "What happens if a matrix $A$ has 0 as an eigenvalue?\n",
    "\n",
    "<br> \n",
    "\n",
    "This happens if and only if there is a nontrivial solution to the equation\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\begin{align*}\n",
    "A\\mathbf{x} &= 0\\mathbf{x} \\\\\n",
    "A\\mathbf{x} &= {\\bf 0}.\n",
    "\\end{align*}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "<br>\n",
    "\n",
    "By the IMT, the homogeneous equation has a nontrivial solution if and only if $A$ is not invertible. Hence, 0 is an eigenvalue of $A$ if and only if $A$ is not invertible.\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## Invertibility\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{style=\"font-size: .8em\"}\n",
    "So we have yet another addition to the Invertible Matrix Theorem!"
