    "<br>\n",
    "\n",
    " Similarity is a symmetric relationship: if $A$ is similar to $B$, then $B$ is similar to $A$.  Hence we just say that $A$ and $B$ _are similar._\n",
    " \n",
    "<br> \n",
    "Changing $A$ into $B$ is called a __similarity transformation.__\n",
    "\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "## Similarity\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{style=\"font-size: .8em\"}"
   ]
  },
